OsmAnd AIDL API (net.osmand.aidlapi.*)
--------------------------------------
The Android app's turn-by-turn navigation-cue feature (qhybrid.android.navcue.*)
sources next-turn data from OsmAnd / OsmAnd+ via its public AIDL API. The AIDL
interface + parcelable surface under `net.osmand.aidlapi.*`
(android/src/main/aidl/net/osmand/aidlapi/ + the matching parcelable .java impls
under android/src/main/java/net/osmand/aidlapi/) is VENDORED VERBATIM from:

    OsmAnd
    https://github.com/osmandapp/OsmAnd  (OsmAnd-api/src/net/osmand/aidlapi)
    Copyright (C) the OsmAnd contributors

It is the documented client-integration path (the same files the official
`osmandapp/osmand-api-demo` instructs integrators to copy). We use only the
navigation-update subset (`registerForNavigationUpdates` / `ADirectionInfo`);
the rest of the surface is present so the AIDL binder method/transaction order
matches the OsmAnd service exactly. No remote dependency, no Google Play
Services, no API key. OsmAnd is GPLv3-compatible with this project's AGPLv3.
